OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Feasing for a time this evening, but
OL,7,Fturning cloudier again overnight with
OL,8,Fa band of heavier rain moving through
OL,9,Fand persisting into dawn.Winds
OL,10,Fremaining light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,13,Foccasional outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fthroughout, particularly through the
OL,15,Fmorning, otherwise reamaining murky.
